        }
       },
       {
        "name": {
         "orig": "Zla'nyoro",
         "transl": "Zla'nyoro"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "\\v[lore.title.seeker], day is hot and so is mood of the Shad.\\. If only evil beasts were gone.",
         "transl": "Seeker, Tag sein heiß wie Laune von Shad.\\. Wenn doch nur böse Biester weg wären."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "event": [
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "name": {
         "orig": "Zla'nyoro",
         "transl": "Zla'nyoro"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "\\v[lore.title.seeker], thank you for defeating evil beasts.\\. Now Shad mood cooled down.",
         "transl": "Danke für Besiegen böse Biester, Seeker.\\. Laune von Shad wieder abgekühlt."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Weather still hot, however.\\. Human cooling box would be a useful.",
         "transl": "Wetter trotzdem noch heiß.\\. Kühlbox von Mensch jetzt nützlich wären."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "event": {
       "quest": [
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "name": {
          "orig": "Zla'nyoro",
          "transl": "Zla'nyoro"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "\\v[lore.title.seeker], thank you for defeating evil beasts.\\. Now Shad mood cooled down.",
          "transl": "Danke für Besiegen böse Biester, Seeker.\\. Laune von Shad wieder abgekühlt."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Weather still hot, however.\\. Human cooling box would be a useful.",
          "transl": "Wetter trotzdem noch heiß.\\. Kühlbox von Mensch jetzt nützlich wären."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Hi!\\. Wait!",
          "transl": "Hi!\\. Warte!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "PROUD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Ohh, cooling boxes want become part of Shad village?\\. What a blessing!",
          "transl": "Ohh, Kühlboxen suchen neues zu Hause in Shad-Dorf?\\. Ahnen sei Dank!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Lea!",
          "transl": "Лія!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "EXCITED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Mhm, but human devices need power, yes?\\. None of that in humble village.",
          "transl": "Mhm, aber Menschmaschine brauchen Strom, ja?\\. Wir nicht haben in unser bescheiden Dorf."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "THINKING"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Elder no like human powermachine.\\. But maybe my nephew Owo can find solution.",
          "transl": "Älteste mögen Menschmaschine nicht.\\. Aber Neffe Owo von mir vielleicht finden Lösung."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "He smart shad, full of dream and aspire!\\. Even studied human science at coolleg in city!",
          "transl": "Er schlauer Shad, voll Traum und Tatendrang!\\. Sogar studiert Mänschen-Wissenschaft an Hohe Schule in Stadt."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...!",
          "transl": "...!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "ASTONISHED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "At day you can often find him in room of his, on hill to right of you!\\. Hope he help.",
          "transl": "Du finden ihn bei Tag in sein Zimmer, auf Hügel rechts von dir!\\. Hoffe, er dir helfen."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "baki.male-pink-tall",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[киває]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Bye!",
          "transl": "Бувай!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "EXCITED"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
